Decriel is a security-first programming language originated and created by
Bryce Lovell.

IX-Decriel is the official public research repository for Decriel.

The IX prefix identifies this repository as part of the IX research ecosystem.
It does not change the language name. The language name is Decriel.

Decriel stands for Declarative Effects and Capabilities for Runtime Integrity,
Evidence, and Least-Authority.

